invariant: INV-67
file: mldsa.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mldsa-vector
reason: mldsa.c's forward transform calls mldsa_poly.c's loop in a
  host object, so every verification runs that transform at the loop's
  speed. Every verdict stays right, because the loop computes the same
  coefficients; only the time is wrong. bin/mldsa_runtime_test counts
  the calls into the lanes that a verification makes under each
  ch_cfg.cpu value, and the script runs it for arm64 under qemu-aarch64
  and for x86-64 under qemu-x86_64.

--- old
static void mld_ntt(uint32_t cpu, mld_poly *p) {
#if MLD_VECTOR
--- new
